{"4302420": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Truck Master", "steam_appid": 4302420, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Truck Master</strong> is a top-down logistics simulation game where your job is to direct the trucks to unload  cargo at specific drop off points. <br><br>Click and drag to create routes for trucks. Navigate the right trucks to the correctly colored drop off point.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302420/extras/331f248393a50c41751091484dcd350d.poster.avif?t=1786608628\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302420/extras/331f248393a50c41751091484dcd350d.webm?t=1786608628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302420/extras/331f248393a50c41751091484dcd350d.mp4?t=1786608628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan ahead on how to route currently available trucks to avoid collisions for other upcoming trucks. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302420/extras/c1f202a1560395183d3993d3b5430a36.poster.avif?t=1786608628\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302420/extras/c1f202a1560395183d3993d3b5430a36.webm?t=1786608628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302420/extras/c1f202a1560395183d3993d3b5430a36.mp4?t=1786608628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging maps that will test even the most skilled planners. Yes, you can stop trucks from moving if you need to. But that will cause congestion which needs to be cleared up, adding to the pressure of operations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302420/extras/4cdfab63ba385132db96f37c29035b92.poster.avif?t=1786608628\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302420/extras/4cdfab63ba385132db96f37c29035b92.webm?t=1786608628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302420/extras/4cdfab63ba385132db96f37c29035b92.mp4?t=1786608628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate through some of the narrowest lanes without a single scratch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302420/extras/d3ce3fe0e412da88531ca66998f161d4.poster.avif?t=1786608628\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302420/extras/d3ce3fe0e412da88531ca66998f161d4.webm?t=1786608628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302420/extras/d3ce3fe0e412da88531ca66998f161d4.mp4?t=1786608628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategize your routes and plan your bottlenecks depending on the map. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302420/extras/259fbac54c64660ac7b98c465700aae7.poster.avif?t=1786608628\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asse